SPEC core_payment
METADATA CURRENCY "EUR"
METADATA SOURCE arrears bank
ACTIVATION OK
BLOCK OK
TYPES OK
TERM 1 MUST tenant pay(landlord, 1200) DEADLINE 1773187200 : BREACHED 1773187200 PENALTY 170 NOTIFY landlord CURE FULFILLED
TERM 2 ON_BREACH tenant : BOUND 1
TERM 3 MUST_NOT landlord enter(tenant) : PENDING
TERM 4 ON_BREACH landlord : BOUND 3
